   "html": "<p>Fashioned after classic Hollywood red carpet photography, Jesse brought his expert eye to the event to capture intimate and behind the scenes moments with the talent, and high profile guests to create atmospheric snapshots worthy of the prestige status of the film.</p>\n<p>Black and white selects of stars Rachel Zegler, Ariana DeBose, Ansel Elgort, Rita Moreno and Director Steven Spielberg were provided the morning after to share with fans across Disney’s and talent’s socials.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "RED CARPET SHOWCASE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Jesse was tasked with capturing relevant guests at the premiere to showcase the overall glamor and excitement of the scene. Such notables included Martin Short, Rachel Brosnahan, and a wide variety of Speilberg cohorts. With such a large cast and the attendance of the Disney executive staff, it was a lively scene that resulted in magical results worthy of the Oscar nominated film.</p>\n<p>‍</p>"
    },
